1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Recruiters skim right past this resume line. Here's the fix.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:08,000
Responsible for helping customers. It says nothing about what you did.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Ask yourself three things: how many, what tools, and what changed because of you.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,500
Now it reads: resolved forty to sixty customer issues per shift, including returns and escalations.

5
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:23,000
If you use AI to rewrite it, tell it: use only my facts and never invent numbers.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,500
That example is illustrative. Use your own real numbers.

7
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:29,500
Follow for more resume fixes.
